# Design system

`design-system/` is the canonical NRITAX 2.0 design system.

- Change colours, type, spacing, radius, elevation, and motion only in `design-system/tokens/`.
- `web/src/app/globals.css` imports those tokens and adds app `.ntx-*` utilities — do not duplicate token values in the app.
- Before new UI, read `design-system/readme.md` and the relevant `design-system/components/` kit.
- Prefer existing `.ntx-*` classes and CSS variables over ad-hoc Tailwind greys or new brand colours.
- Voice: sentence case, no emoji, outcome-named buttons, statute references in the margin, Indian digit grouping.
